      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792643481022,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5  value ≤ maxValuePerCall（这里是 0）\n6  按 ruleKind 查参数\n     APPROVE：spender 受信，amount ≤ 剩余额度\n     BUY / SELL：recipient == 账户，\n       now ≤ deadline ≤ now + 600 s，token ≠ MockUSD\n     SELL：amount ≤ 这把 key 的 inventory\n7  记下余额快照（MockUSD；买卖时还有 token）",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5  value ≤ maxValuePerCall（这里是 0）\n6  按 ruleKind 查参数\n     APPROVE：spender 受信，amount ≤ 剩余额度\n     BUY / SELL：recipient == 账户，\n       now ≤ deadline ≤ now + 600 s，token ≠ MockUSD\n     SELL：amount ≤ 这把 key 的 inventory\n7  记下余额快照（MockUSD；买卖时还有 token）",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.5
